  "notes": "r5 of njh_wc_mandi_umum (Ichsan t470). Waiting_bench removed (it read as a train-station bench and did not belong in a WC). Shower removed — kamar mandi uses water_tub (bak + gayung); water_tub's native action is bathe, so mandi still works. Three squat WC stalls stay on the back wall at (0,0)/(2,0)/(4,0) with sekat_wc at (1,0)/(3,0)/(5,0) rot 90. Two kamar mandi stalls on the right wall: water_tub at (7,0) and (7,2) rot 270 (entry at (6,0)/(6,2)), sekat_wc at (7,1) and closing (7,3) rot 0. Sinks flush on the left wall at (0,2)/(0,3) rot 90 (backsplash against the wall, fronts into the room). wudhu_tap on the door-wall corner (7,5) rot 180 (I1 has a true back; side-wall rot 90/270 visual front disagrees with t394). Trash bin in the left-front corner (0,5). Clear central aisle. Toilets stay rot 0 / SW. r4 untouched.",
